{"type":"text","timestamp":1794359719605,"sessionID":"ses_e37d908adffevt5SKz66hGNbR8","part":{"id":"prt_1c82c769e001apKuNn9J9L1Qu6","messageID":"msg_1c82c68f0001FaIRN8YG9WPlqc","sessionID":"ses_e37d908adffevt5SKz66hGNbR8","type":"text","text":"Built the full base64 converter.\n\n**Backend** (`backend/app.py`): SQLite (WAL, `./data/app.sqlite3`), PBKDF2 password hashing, bearer-token sessions, all specified endpoints with per-user isolation, UTF-8 encode/decode with strict base64 validation, empty-input support, pagination, and previews.\n\n**Frontend** (`frontend/src/App.tsx`): auth forms, signed-in header, encode/decode textareas, copy button, API error display, save-to-history toggle, paged history with delete, styled entirely with Tailwind utilities via `src/index.css`.\n\nAlso added Tailwind deps/plugin, fixed the Dockerfile lock install (`--require-hashes`, which matches the hashed lockfile — the old constraints invocation failed), added `.gitignore`, and verified build + API behavior end-to-end.","time":{"start":1794359719582,"end":1794359719586}}}
